From: OpenStack Incus maintainers <openstack-incus@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] objects: Register external Incus live migration data

The Incus compute driver carries destination compatibility facts in a
LiveMigrateData subclass. Import the external object from register_all() so
conductor and compute services can deserialize it across RPC boundaries.

diff --git a/nova/objects/__init__.py b/nova/objects/__init__.py
--- a/nova/objects/__init__.py
+++ b/nova/objects/__init__.py
@@ -98,6 +98,7 @@ def register_all():
     __import__('nova.objects.instance_numa')
     __import__('nova.objects.instance_pci_requests')
     __import__('nova.objects.keypair')
+    __import__('nova.virt.incus.migrate_data')
     __import__('nova.objects.migrate_data')
     __import__('nova.objects.virt_device_metadata')
     __import__('nova.objects.migration')
